    "theorem": "MsolveDegreeWordAudit.actual_degree_word_certificate",
    "statement": "theorem actual_degree_word_certificate : ActualWordBounds ∧ ActualPolynomialBoundary ∧ ActualRecordedPrefix ∧ LegacyFullF4Statement",
    "decl_sha256": "285221ce90632adbf8398f66d7c011b1c8b9ad6cdc5be42b95e1616cd6011e64",
    "scope": "Actual UInt16 degree-sum exactness iff no wrap; all-field x^(n+2)+1,x^(n+1)y family excludes y from every original degree(n+2) F4Run but admits a degree(n+3) run. Actual decoded written boundary set and captured word logs satisfy the checked mathematical obstruction. Native control passes; boundary times out124, so normal execution validation fails and only recorded prefix facts are claimed. Full inherited7clause F4 statement rebound; historical prefix separately detected. No C/parser/compiler/independent-host refinement, signed standing or full14 closure.",
